# The rye's stalk and ear seen close (reports/content/2026-11-19-crop-fields/ear.md): the bend of the straw and the
# ear's card with its grains and awns, and how the card passes into the plain strip with the distance. The second
# strip of rye of Onar's north field of the set built with seed 7 (59060 2150 -9300, the strip runs along 0.05 0 -1).
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> scripts/bench.sh crop-onar-ear <out>
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
goto pos 57094 1850 -11100
# beside the strip's east edge, 1.3 m off it, a man's eyes on the ears along the wall
cam at 59440 2300 -9150 59290 2262 -9500
clear 3000
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
shot close-1
wait 300
# 3 m off the edge: the card going into the strip along the wall
cam at 59610 2310 -9050 59290 2250 -9700
wait 5000
shot close-3
wait 300
# 6 m off: past the card's range
cam at 59910 2330 -9000 59290 2240 -9900
wait 5000
shot close-6
wait 300
# from 2 m over the ears, down at 45 degrees
cam at 59060 2480 -9100 59060 2270 -9300
wait 5000
shot over-2
wait 300
# clip: a gust through the wall from 3 m
cam at 59610 2310 -9050 59290 2250 -9700
foliage wait-gust 4000 -9300
rec gust-close
wait 10000
stop
wait 500
